WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/VehicleConfigSection.tsx — a pure presentational section that
  receives `vehicleConfig: VehicleConfigSnapshot | null | undefined` and `softwareVersion: string | undefined` as
  props from the vehicle-detail page (which reads them off the vehicle-state query). Render:

    <GlassPanel className="p-6">
      <header>  <Settings icon, neon-cyan/>  "Vehicle Configuration" (t('vehicles.detail.vehicleConfig')) </header>
      configItems = vehicleConfig ? [12 rows] : []
      configItems.length > 0 ? <KVList items columns={2}/> : <Skeleton lines={4} height={16}/>
    </GlassPanel>

  The 12 rows (order + label key + value rule, reproduced verbatim — the resolution IS the contract):
     1 Car Type          t('vehicles.detail.carType')        car_type ?? '—'
     2 Trim              t('vehicles.detail.trim')           trim ?? '—'
     3 Exterior Color    t('vehicles.detail.color')          exterior_color ?? '—'
     4 Wheels            t('vehicles.detail.wheels')         wheel_type ?? '—'
     5 Roof Color        t('vehicles.detail.roofColor')      roof_color ?? '—'
     6 Charge Port       t('vehicles.detail.chargePort')     charge_port ?? '—'
     7 Right-Hand Drive  t('vehicles.detail.rhd')            right_hand_drive != null ? (… ? t('common.yes') : t('common.no')) : '—'
     8 Europe Vehicle    t('vehicles.detail.europeVehicle')  europe_vehicle != null ? (yes/no) : '—'
     9 Offroad Lightbar  t('vehicles.detail.offroadLightbar') offroad_lightbar_present != null ? (yes/no) : '—'
    10 Rear Seat Heaters t('vehicles.detail.rearSeatHeaters') rear_seat_heaters ?? '—'
    11 Sunroof           t('vehicles.detail.sunroofInstalled') sunroof_installed ?? '—'
    12 Software          t('vehicles.detail.softwareVersion') software_update_version ?? softwareVersion ?? '—'
  i18n  : 15 keys via t(key, default) — the 12 row labels + the panel title + common.yes / common.no.
  Shared components used: @/components/ui (GlassPanel) · @/components/data-display (KVList) · @/components/feedback (Skeleton).

