                                  web key + English value:fallback). The 15 web keys are reproduced VERBATIM
                                  (vehicles.detail.carType/trim/color/wheels/roofColor/chargePort/rhd/europeVehicle/
                                  offroadLightbar/rearSeatHeaters/sunroofInstalled/softwareVersion/vehicleConfig +
                                  common.yes/no); the P4 leaf chrome adds vehicles.detail.config.*.
  a11y                          → each row combined into one element ("{label}: {value}"); chip / refresh / retry labelled;
                                  Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens; Reduce Motion via TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton; the panel is an
                                  a11y container titled "Vehicle Configuration".
  telemetry                     → view.opened surface="VehicleConfigSection" emitted once on the first applied snapshot.

STATES (every state renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → skeleton key/value rows (web `vehicleConfig` absent while fetching).
  empty    → "No configuration reported yet" + a gear glyph (the web renders a perpetual skeleton when the snapshot is
             null; the P4 leaf contract surfaces a friendly message instead) — never a blank box.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web has no error branch).
  data     → the 12 key/value rows in the web order, each value resolved (dash / yes-no / software fallback).
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known content; no auto-refresh.

